  "answer_text": "Here is how you can log in to **PreLicenseTraining.com**:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd10 PreLicenseTraining.com Login\n\n**PreLicenseTraining.com** offers insurance pre-license training and continuing education courses online for insurance professionals.\n\n**To log in to your account, visit:**\n\ud83d\udc49 [https://prelicensetraining.com/login](https://prelicensetraining.com/login)\n\n---\n\n### Other Login Options:\n\n| Portal | Link |\n|---|---|\n| **Student Login** | [prelicensetraining.com/login](https://prelicensetraining.com/login) |\n| **Mentor / Recruiter Login** | [prelicensetraining.com/ca/mentor/register](https://prelicensetraining.com/ca/mentor/register) |\n| **PSI Learning Academy Login** | [psionline.prelicensetraining.com](https://psionline.prelicensetraining.com/register) |\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udca1 Tips:\n- If you **don't have an account yet**, you can register at: [prelicensetraining.com/register](https://prelicensetraining.com/register)\n- If you've **forgotten your password**, look for the \"Forgot Password\" link on the login page.\n- Make sure you're using the correct portal (Student vs. Mentor/Recruiter).\n\nLet me know if you need further help! \ud83d\ude0a",
